  "tillverkar_beskrivning": {
    "text": "The Opera slatted roof can be surface-mounted or self-supporting. Enrich your luxury 'outdoor room' with extra comforts such as glass or wooden sliding walls, dimmable LED lighting, heating and integrated screens. The Opera slatted roof can be surface-mounted on the building or installed as a free-standing unit, on four posts. Thanks to precise customisation, the slatted roof can be matched perfectly to your home. Create additional comfort and atmosphere with glass or wooden sliding walls, dimmable LED lighting (white or RGB), dimmable LED spotlights, windproof screens, heating and integrated sensors (sun, rain, temperature and wind). With a maximum width of 5.5 m, depth of 7 m, height of 3 m and an impressive span of 38,5 m² per module, this system offers versatility and a spacious solution. It is also 'connectable', both in width and depth.",
